==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features both the male and female forms of {{p|Jellicent}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Jellicent|31}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Devour Soul''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Dusknoir|62}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

